Reconciliation exit safety — minimal change for the existing engine
===================================================================

SUPPLIED FOR REVIEW. NOT APPLIED.

The standing rule is that the original installation is never modified, so this
diff is shipped rather than executed. Apply it deliberately, after reading it.

Target: polymarket-quant-bridge/pqb/reconcile.py

What it changes: the loop at lines 121-153 stops closing a lifecycle on a
single absence from one snapshot. Instead it requires either authoritative
evidence (market resolved / confirmed exit fill / observed zero balance) or
N corroborating absences across separate cycles from a healthy source.

What it does NOT change: entry logic, sizing, compounding, filters, thresholds,
wallet logic, the adoption path, the resize path, the balance check, or the
halt behaviour.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
