ALSO REQUIRED — one line, elsewhere:

  pqb/decision/high_confidence.py::_load_setups

  The empirical gate reads every CLOSED lifecycle and scores realized_pnl > 0
  as a win, so any reconciliation closure teaches it something that was never
  decided. Add the quarantine:

      WHERE l.status='CLOSED'
  ->  WHERE l.status='CLOSED'
        AND COALESCE(l.exit_style,'') NOT IN
            ('reconciled', 'reconciliation_unverified')

  Historical rows carrying exit_style='reconciled' were written with no
  verification and must be excluded until each is re-verified.

OPTIONAL, and the complete fix for the root cause:

  pqb/adapters/data_adapter.py::exchange_positions

  Distinguish "the venue reports no positions" from "the call failed / returned
  nothing". Raising, or returning a sentinel, on a failed call would stop the
  empty-snapshot case from ever reaching the reconciler.

